WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.490
One class recording holds many moments worth sharing.

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:05.680
Reel Studio finds them for you.

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:07.920
Start from the dashboard.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.300
Upload a recording, or create a video from

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.330
just a topic.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:15.660
Drop in a class.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.760
Reel Studio transcribes the Hinglish on your own machine,

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.700
and corrects technical terms like useEffect,

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.490
using the code on screen.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.280
It ranks complete thirty to sixty second moments,

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.360
explains why each one works,

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.780
and reframes the widescreen class into a

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:33.310
readable vertical reel.

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:35.010
No recording?

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:38.310
Type a topic like JSON versus XML,

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:39.950
and get an editable script,

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:42.540
animated code and a natural voiceover.

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:45.460
Then fine tune it in the editor.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:48.260
Trim clips, edit captions word by word,

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:49.920
apply your brand and a style,

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.930
and render a new MP4.

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:53.550
When it is ready,

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:55.190
publish straight to Instagram,

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:56.800
or schedule it for later.
